      <title>Preparing your Student Account For Spring and Beyond Webinar Second Webinar</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/54364142049094/huge/16c871ed267c7566549a7c15d1d3cf55c575aa59.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Tue, 10 Nov 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>Spring registration will be here before you know it. Join Student Financial Services for a practical webinar designed to help you understand your student account, address outstanding balances, and prepare for registration before deadlines arrive.
<br> </p>

<p>We’ll discuss how registration holds work, strategies for closing the gap on past-due balances, how donor and emergency funding work, completing Financial Aid action items and accepting awards, tracking missing external scholarships, and when you should begin reviewing and planning for your next semester’s financial obligations.
<br> </p>

<p>The goal is simple: start early, know what is outstanding, and take action now so your student account does not become a barrier to registration.</p>

