      <title>360 Degree Professionalism &amp; Civility</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/54250559253004/huge/634052b7f4ccde5cccca3c6a76264983c8f01f32.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Tue, 10 Nov 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>Howard’s 360 Degree Professionalism &amp; Civility training equips employees with practical tools to strengthen respectful communication, workplace relationships, accountability, inclusion, and professional excellence. Grounded in Howard’s B.I.S.O.N. Way values, this interactive virtual training helps participants identify uncivil behaviors, navigate challenging workplace interactions, and build trust, psychological safety, and collaboration. Through real-world scenarios, dialogue, and reflection, employees will explore how professionalism and civility shape workplace culture, well-being, teamwork, and institutional effectiveness and leave with strategies to support a more respectful, inclusive, and productive Howard workplace.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Register today: <a href="https://www.myworkday.com/howard/learning/offering/07b0b861f0641001a69eecc19dde0000?type=7c48590b5257100009485b7a25ae0068">https://www.myworkday.com/howard/learning/offering/07b0b861f0641001a69eecc19dde0000?type=7c48590b5257100009485b7a25ae0068</a></p>

